tyle=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Achieve full marks</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Signed up</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Exercise</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: solid #000000 1pt;\"> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Exercise 3 </span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong style=\"font-size: medium; font-style: normal; white-space-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Exercise 4</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">A Busy Weekend for Lan</span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Nunito Regular';\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Lan is a high school student who _______ <strong>(1)</strong> very hard to prepare for her final exams. She _______ <strong>(2)</strong> at a local café every Saturday morning to study because she _______ <strong>(3)</strong> it is quieter than studying at home. Last weekend, Lan _______ <strong>(4)</strong> to the café as usual, but it _______ <strong>(5)</strong> closed for renovations.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Nunito Regular';\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Surprised, she _______ <strong>(6)</strong> to find another place to study. She _______ <strong>(7) </strong>a new coffee shop down the street, which _______ <strong>(8)</strong> a cozy atmosphere. By the time she _______ <strong>(9)</strong> a seat, she _______ <strong>(10)</strong> already _______ <strong>(10)</strong> a lot of time.</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Nunito Regular';\"><span style=\"font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">This week, Lan's schedule _______ <strong>(11)</strong> packed. She _______ <strong>(12)</strong> to attend a workshop on study techniques on Sunday. Her friend, Mai, _______ <strong>(13)</strong> her about the workshop and said it _______ <strong>(14)</strong> be very helpful. Lan _______ <strong>(15) </strong>looking forward to learning new tips that _______ <strong>(16)</strong> help her study more effectively.</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Nunito Regular';\"> </p>",
